{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちたーん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の放送を見てくれた方が\nたくさんいて、それに大好評\nで凄く嬉しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁみたんだけじゃなく\n乃木坂46ふぁんの皆さんにも\n愛されるような曲に\nなったらいいな( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今日は握手会などで\n販売されている生写真の撮影を\nしてきました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どの衣装も凄く可愛いいので\n出来上がりが楽しみです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/02/26/8367513/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはこの前の握手会で\n発売されてたスーツ姿。\nはじめて着たの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これのタイトルは教師！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと高校の教師は\n出来なさそうだから\n小学生なら...なんて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんが皆の授業\nしちゃうぞ( •ㅈ• )うは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いものが止まらない♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/02/26/8367513/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんは苺味よ。\nなんてったって苺星の\nお姫様だから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}